%% Logical view: ingestion, retrieval, grounding.
flowchart LR
  subgraph Ingestion
    pdf[PDF] --> pages[Pages: text layer or OCR]
    pages --> blocks[Text and table blocks]
    blocks --> chunks[Chunks + contextual headers]
    chunks --> index[(BM25 + dense vectors)]
  end
  subgraph Answering
    q[Question] --> rw[Rewrite + route]
    rw --> hy[Hybrid search + RRF]
    index --> hy
    hy --> rr[Rerank]
    rr --> gate{Refusal gate}
    gate --> llm[LLM with ratio tool]
    llm --> cite[Ground citations]
  end
